{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And he spoke, etc.</b> ״לֵאמֹר אַךְ״ etc. — meaning, he diminishes by multiplying words." "<b>I have given silver, etc.</b> — meaning: if he resolved to give him the field by way of gift, he too resolved to give him the silver by way of gift. ״קַח מִמֶּנִּי״ — and then I shall accept your gift, ״וְאֶקְבְּרָה אֶת״ etc."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:42:51.986050270Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}